 # TLOU PC gains ~10% from trained PGO+LTO; an x86 profile cannot train ARM64.
 # Reuse its LTO setup for the Android GPU only. Can disable at build time with
 # TLOU_ANDROID_LTO=OFF; this is a binary setting, not a launcher experiment.
+# TLOU_ANDROID_MARCH (default armv8.2-a, as FEX's TUNE_ARCH): every 64-bit Snapdragon since the
+# 845 has it, the AYN Odin 3 (Snapdragon 8 Elite) far more. Atomics become single LSE
+# instructions instead of LL/SC loops or outlined helper calls - the draw pipe, rings and
+# counters of the GPU threads run on them. TLOU_ANDROID_MARCH=armv8-a restores the baseline.
